<p>Renders a file fragment into the page</p>
<b>Parameters</b>
<ul><li> pageName = Page where the file is attached (optional, default = current page)</li>
<li> fileName = Name of the fragment file to render</li>
</ul>
<xmp class="panel" of-exclude="true">
<!--Extension RenderFile pageName="/OpenForum/Extensions/RenderFile" fileName="example-list.fragment" --><ul><li> One</li>
<li> Two</li>
<li> Three</li></ul><!--End Extension RenderFile pageName="/OpenForum/Extensions/RenderFile" fileName="example-list.fragment" -->
</xmp>

<div class="row">
  <h3>RenderFile</h3>

